═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

✅ Booking Created Successfully!

📋 BOOKING DETAILS:
• Booking ID: #2025
• Service: Consulta General
• Date: Monday, October 20, 2025
• Time: 14:00 (2:00 PM)
• Duration: 30 minutes

📧 Confirmation email will be sent to: user@example.com

Next actions:
1️⃣ Make another booking
2️⃣ View all bookings
3️⃣ Need help?

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
📋 PATTERN 2: RESCHEDULE CONFIRMATION (BEFORE → AFTER)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

✅ Booking Rescheduled Successfully!

🔴 BEFORE:
• Booking #2025
• Service: Consulta General
• Date/Time: Friday, October 18, 10:00 AM

🟢 AFTER:
